{
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_immunity": "Storm Hide",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_immunity.desc": "■ Your scales shield you from §2fire§r§7, §2explosion§r§7 and §2lightning§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 The §folder§r§7 you become, the stronger your protection grows. Ancient Dragons gains almost complete immunity.\n\n§f■§r§7 Toggle skill with §fCtrl + Left Click§r§7 on skill icon.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_invis": "Shadow Invisibility",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_invis.desc": "■ Gain §2invisibility§r§7 by leveling this skill. It continuously consumes your §5mana§r§7, allowing you to disappear from enemies and prey. If the dragon is wearing §farmor§r§7, its invisibility effect is reduced.\n\n■ Using this skill in a §5well-lit§r§7 area increases §5Hunger§r§7, causing you to consume more food. Higher skill levels reduce the level of this effect.\n\n§f■§r§7 Toggle skill with §fCtrl + Left Click§r§7 on skill icon. The skill cannot activate without §fenough mana§r§7.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_echolocation": "Echolocation",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_echolocation.desc": "■ Your dragon can use §2echolocation§r§7 to detect creatures and items.\n\n§f■§r§7 At lower levels, its range is very limited. As you upgrade this skill, you will be able to sense creatures and items from much greater distances.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_eyes": "Striker Eyes",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_eyes.desc": "■ Grants §2night vision§r§7. At maximum level, your vision is enhanced even §2underwater§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 Toggle skill with §fCtrl + Left Click§r§7 on skill icon. If you don't have §fenough mana§r§7, the skill won't activate.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_paw_swipe": "Paw Swipe",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_paw_swipe.desc": "■ §2Knock enemies§r§7 in front of you back slightly and deal §2damage that ignores armor§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 The §folder§r§7 the dragon, the stronger its attack and the farther it knocks enemies back. Damage unaffected by claws and teeth slot.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_tail_swipe": "Tail Swipe",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_tail_swipe.desc": "■ §2Knocks enemies§r§7 far away and deals a small amount of §2damage§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 The §folder§r§7 the dragon, the stronger its attack and the farther it knocks enemies back.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_plasma": "Plasma Shot",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_plasma.desc": "■ Fire a devastating plasma projectile that §2launches enemies§r§7 into the air and deals §2explosive damage§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 The explosion §fdestroys blocks§r§7, but §2saves item drops§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 Young dragons should use this ability with caution, as they can still be §5caught in the blast§r§7.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_plasma_ly": "Plasma Shot, low-yield",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_plasma_ly.desc": "■ Fire a devastating plasma projectile that §2launches enemies§r§7 into the air and deals §2explosive damage§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 Reduced yield of the ordinary plasma projectile for more §fsurgical§r§7, pinpoint accuracy for singular targets at the cost of §fless damage and destruction§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7 Young dragons should use this ability with caution, as they can still be §5caught in the blast§r§7.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_plasma_breath": "Plasma Breath",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_plasma_breath.desc": "■ You breathe a destructive stream of plasma that §2ignores armor§r§7 and sets enemies §2burning§r§7.",
	
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_climbing": "Climbing claws",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_climbing.desc": "■ You can climb §2all the surfaces§r§7 thanks to your §2grippy claws§r§7.\n\n§f■§r§7Skill cannot be active if you don't have §fenough hunger§r§7.",
	
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_not_enough_hunger": "You are too exhausted by hunger: cannot climb and hold onto surfaces.",
	
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_item_blacklist": "Item Restriction",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_item_blacklist.desc": "■ Dragons are §dunable to wield§r§7 or equip certain items, including bows, shields, and tridents. These items cannot be equipped and will be §cdropped§r§7 from your hotbar, but they can still be crafted or used in other crafts.",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_fear_1": "Fear and Terror",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_fear_1.desc": "■ Your presence alone inspires fear. Due to your reputation and the legacy of your progenitor, animals and Villagers will try to §davoid§r§7 you, while hunters will actively seek you out.\n\n■ Build a §2«Beacon»§7 with the Animal Peace effect to make creatures more accepting of you.",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_fear_2": "Fear and Terror",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_fear_2.desc": "■ Your presence alone inspires fear. Due to your reputation and the legacy of your progenitor, animals and Villagers will try to §davoid§r§7 you, while hunters will actively seek you out.\n\n■ Build a §2«Beacon»§7 with the Animal Peace effect to make creatures more accepting of you.",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_hunger": "High Metabolism",
	"dragon_penalty.dragonsurvival.night_striker_hunger.desc": "■ Your immense power demands constant energy. Sprinting consumes §dmuch more food than usual§r§7.",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_mana": "Striker Mana",
	"dragon_ability.dragonsurvival.night_striker_mana.desc": "■ Upgrading this ability increases your §2maximum mana pool§r§7 and allows to restore mana by being in §fshadows and dark places§r§7.\n\n■ §8The more levels you have, the more mana you get automatically.",
	"skin_part.dragonsurvival.night_striker.none": "",
