	"item_group.night_striker_ds.night_striker_ds": "Night Striker - Dragon Survival Addon",
	"dragon_species.dragonsurvival.night_striker": "Night Striker",
	"dragon_species.dragonsurvival.night_striker.altar.desc": "§7■ §6Night Strikers§r§r§7 are exceptionally proficient in terms of speed, stealth, and surgical powerful strikes from above. \n\n§2■ Features:§f§r§7 immune to electricity and fire. Ability to turn invisible. Increased speed and agility. Echolocation. Night vision. Armor-piercing plasma fire and paw swipes. Knockback tail swipes.\n§4■ Weakness:§r§7 Villagers are always afraid. Actively tracked down by Hunters. Energy-intensive - more food is needed than for other dragons.\n§6■ Diet:§r %s",
	"dragon_species.dragonsurvival.night_striker.banner.desc": "§7■ §6Night Strikers§r§r§7 are exceptionally proficient in terms of speed, stealth, and surgical powerful strikes from above. \n\n§2■ Features:§f§r§7 immune to electricity and fire. Ability to turn invisible. Increased speed and agility. Echolocation. Night vision. Armor-piercing plasma fire and paw swipes. Knockback tail swipes.\n§4■ Weakness:§r§7 Villagers are always afraid. Actively tracked down by Hunters. Energy-intensive - more food is needed than for other dragons.",
    "dragon_species.dragonsurvival.night_striker.locked": "§7■§6Night Striker§7 is the embodiment of speed, stealth, and devastating firepower.\n\n§2■ Traits:§7 Immune to lightning and fire, invisibility, high-speed flight, echolocation, night vision, plasma attacks.\n§4■ Weaknesses:§7 Villagers fear you, hunters hunt you, high metabolism.\n\n§3■ Unlock Conditions:§7\n1. Complete the §6Beginner Tutorial§7.\n2. Obtain the §6Hero of the Village§7 advancement.§r"
}
